{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "grownupsvet-observability",
  "title": "GrownupsVet · operación y latencia HTTP",
  "description": "Preparación I7a. Métricas operativas; no certifica M1–M9 ni un despliegue hasta comprobar fuente, revisión, carga y persistencia.",
  "tags": [
    "grownupsvet",
    "prometheus",
    "backend"
  ],
  "timezone": "America/Bogota",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Servicio",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(process_uptime_seconds{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\"}, service_name)",
        "definition": "label_values(process_uptime_seconds{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\"}, service_name)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "revision",
        "label": "Revisión",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(process_uptime_seconds{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",service_name=~\"$service\"}, revision)",
        "definition": "label_values(process_uptime_seconds{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",service_name=~\"$service\"}, revision)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alcance de la evidencia",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "I7a prepara métricas HTTP/JVM. Selecciona servicio, revisión y período. Un panel sin datos no es un aprobado. **M1/M2/M4/M5/M7/M8 requieren escenarios y verificación de persistencia; M3/M6/M9 requieren carga declarada y P95 exacto además de este histograma aproximado.** Metas y resultados se documentan por separado."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "P95 HTTP por operación y revisión (aproximado)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, method, uri, revision) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\",uri=~\"/api/v1/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{uri}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones por segundo (incluye respuestas de error)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (method, uri, revision) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\",uri=~\"/api/v1/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{uri}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores HTTP 5xx por segundo",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (method, uri, revision) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\",uri=~\"/api/v1/.*\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{uri}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Respuestas HTTP por estado (negocios y fallos separados)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status, revision) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\",uri=~\"/api/v1/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria heap utilizada (auxiliar)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (instance, revision) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\",area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conexiones activas PostgreSQL (auxiliar)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (pool, instance, revision) (hikaricp_connections_active{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pool}} {{instance}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disponibilidad del scrape por instancia",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{service_name=~\"$service\",revision_name=~\"$revision\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} · {{revision_name}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bool",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tiempo de proceso (reinicios visibles, auxiliar)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (instance, revision) (process_uptime_seconds{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Commits por operación (tasa, sin porcentaje de aceptación)",
      "description": "Mutaciones efectivas observadas después del commit. Excluye replays y rollback. Contador en memoria: puede perder muestras ante caída/reinicio; no certifica M1/M4/M7.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (operation, revision) (rate(grownupsvet_business_commits_total{application=\"grownupsvet-backend\",revision=~\"$revision\",service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{revision}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
